      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp01_select_02",
      "hash64": "6CA970E2386E0972",
      "text": "Vous exagérez...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "333149F8746991C6",
      "text": "Mouah ha ha ! Quel aplomb ! T’es aussi à l’aise\\nqu’un Nigirigon dans la gueule d’un Oyacata ![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp01_03b",
      "hash64": "6652552DCF6279AC",
      "text": "Mouah ha ha ! La modestie, c’est bien, mais à\\npetite dose ! Faut savoir reconnaître ses qualités ![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "33314CF8746996DF",
      "text": "En tout cas, merci pour cette opportunité.\\nJ’ai pu mettre les voiles une fois de plus ![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "33314BF87469952C",
      "text": "Je sens que moi aussi, je vais apprendre\\ndes tas de choses auprès des élèves ![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp02_00",
      "hash64": "5DAF5EED2B0105C4",
      "text": "C’est un cadre de rêve, ici, avec la mer\\nqui nous entoure ! Que demander de plus ?[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "5DAF5FED2B010777",
      "text": "Ces embruns qui titillent les narines !\\nPour mes Pokémon et moi, y a rien de mieux ![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "5DAF60ED2B01092A",
      "text": "Par contre, le menu de la cafétéria manque\\nclairement de saveurs iodées...[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "5DAF61ED2B010ADD",
      "text": "Franchement, y a la mer et tous ses trésors\\nculinaires juste à côté ! Tu crois pas que\\r\\nles élèves aimeraient y goûter ?[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 122,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp02_select_01",
      "hash64": "DCDC33941635FF0E",
      "text": "Si, ça serait super !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "DCDC32941635FD5B",
      "text": "J’aime bien les plats de la cafétéria, moi...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "5DAF5AED2B00FEF8",
      "text": "À la bonne heure ! Toi et moi, on va faire\\nune équipe géniale, foi de Kombu ![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp02_04b",
      "hash64": "31F61B0012B09FAE",
      "text": "Arrête ton char à voile ! La mer a tant de plaisir\\ngustatif à offrir ! Fais-moi confiance ![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "5DAF5BED2B0100AB",
      "text": "Les petits alevins de l’Institut Myrtille\\nont qu’à bien se tenir !\\c\\nJe vais les régaler avec de bons petits plats,\\nfaçon Kombu ![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 130,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "060394E58E8282B5",
      "text": "Oh, te voilà !\\nÉcoute bien, tu vas pas en croire tes ouïes...[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "060393E58E828102",
      "text": "Figure-toi que mon restaurant a décroché\\nun partenariat avec...\\r\\nla cafétéria de l’Institut Myrtille ![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
