    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp03_select_02",
      "hash64": "B93704623A53F938",
      "text": "J’ai hâte de voir le menu !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "060392E58E827F4F",
      "text": "Bon, ça vient juste d’être décidé, va me falloir\\nun peu de temps pour tout mettre en place.[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_gym_mizu_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "060391E58E827D9C",
      "text": "Pour commencer, je vais revisiter la célèbre\\nSoupe du chef que je sers dans mon restaurant,\\r\\nrien que pour vous ![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
